This product includes data from the Complete HSK Vocabulary dataset:

    https://github.com/drkameleon/complete-hsk-vocabulary

The vocabulary deck at public/mandarin-source.json (simplified hanzi, pinyin,
English glosses, and HSK levels for HSK 3.0 levels 1 to 3) is derived from that
dataset. It is redistributed here under the terms of its MIT License, reproduced
in full below. scripts/build-hsk-corpus.mjs documents the exact transform used
to produce the deck from the source.

